laurel 2403: rmtfs RW_IOVEC: the iovec entries (u8 count + count x 12 bytes: sector, phys, count) must lie inside the TLV the modem sent; topaz read iov[0] entries without a length check (a short or bad request read past the message). Out of bounds = QMI error result, as for a bad buffer address.

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazModem.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazModem.cpp
index 02e597f..d8a8fcd 100644
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazModem.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazModem.cpp
